repository-code: 'https://github.com/project-portfolio-management/project-portfolio-management'
abstract: >-
  A registry of plans (one recursive collection; any plan may contain any other)
  with explainable duplicate matching, and a project-management workspace: tasks,
  critical-path schedule, cost and earned value, resources, risk and issues, and
  governance. A Rust matcher library, a Rust REST service and a SvelteKit
  front end.
keywords:
  - project portfolio management
  - critical path
  - earned value
  - Rust
  - Svelte
